Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3 (<< 3.12), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-systemd, python3-daemon
# Feature 011 (D4, research R3): cuems-common versions before 1.3.0-23 ship
# /etc/cuems/network_map.{xml,xsd} as conffiles. This package installs the
# current network_map.xsd into /etc/cuems from postinst on every configure,
# so an old cuems-common left beside it would record that file as its own
# modified conffile and prompt or park a .dpkg-dist on its next upgrade.
# Breaks makes apt upgrade the pair together. Replaces is deliberately
# absent: nothing under /etc is in this package's manifest (D5), so there is
# no file overlap for Replaces to license.
Breaks: cuems-common (<< 1.3.0-23~)
Description: Cuems utils
 Cuems utils is a set of utilities to work with the cuems project